  /**
   * Cancel a check override that waits for the flow to finish
   *
   * <p>Cancel an override of a feature (step) status that is still <code>pending_until_flow_finishes</code>, so it never applies. The check keeps its status, the cancellation is recorded in the session's activity as <code>FEATURE_OVERRIDE_CANCELLED</code>, and no webhook is sent. The response is the override with <code>state: cancelled</code> and <code>cancel_reason: cancelled_by_reviewer</code>.
   *
   * <p>An override that already applied or was cancelled returns <code>409</code> with the code <code>feature_override_not_pending</code>. Find override IDs with <code>GET /v3/session/{sessionId}/features/overrides/</code> or in the <code>override</code> returned by the feature status update.
   *
   * <p>Requires the <code>write:sessions</code> privilege; a scoped API key needs write access to decisions.
   *
   * <p>{@code POST /v3/session/{sessionId}/features/overrides/{overrideId}/cancel/}
   *
   * @param sessionId UUID of the verification session. Accepts both user (KYC) and business (KYB) session IDs.
   * @param overrideId The `id` of the override to cancel.
   * @param options per-request options that override the client options
   * @return the response body
   */
